{"5043410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snop", "steam_appid": 5043410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNOP - Snowboarding Slop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can snowboard? Prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNOP</strong> is a brutally unforgiving physics-based snowboarding challenge inspired by games like <strong>QWOP</strong>, where every movement matters and every mistake can send you crashing down the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't control a snowboarder — you control the struggle. Each joystick controls a different heel:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left joystick = left heel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right joystick = right heel</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: make it down the course. Actually doing it is the hard part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect awkward movements, ridiculous crashes, and mechanics designed to test your patience. SNOP isn't about smooth tricks or effortless runs — it's about mastering an intentionally difficult control system and overcoming the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer the mountain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>$200 prize</strong> is available for the first person to complete the challenge. Full rules, requirements, and details are available on the DeckTronic web page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck. You'll need it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SNOP - Snowboarding Slop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can snowboard? Prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNOP</strong> is a brutally unforgiving physics-based snowboarding challenge inspired by games like <strong>QWOP</strong>, where every movement matters and every mistake can send you crashing down the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't control a snowboarder — you control the struggle. Each joystick controls a different heel:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left joystick = left heel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right joystick = right heel</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: make it down the course. Actually doing it is the hard part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect awkward movements, ridiculous crashes, and mechanics designed to test your patience. SNOP isn't about smooth tricks or effortless runs — it's about mastering an intentionally difficult control system and overcoming the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer the mountain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>$200 prize</strong> is available for the first person to complete the challenge. Full rules, requirements, and details are available on the DeckTronic web page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck. You'll need it.</p>", "short_description": "SNOP is a brutally unforgiving physics-based snowboarding challenge inspired by games like QWOP, where every movement matters and every mistake can send you crashing down the mountain.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043410/d8e87fd5b69431d7bcef9985e9d986c32d0fb133/header.jpg?t=1787204329", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043410/cd1e42fc5d939ee11fb99e42be8b3803a61a456c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787204329", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043410/cd1e42fc5d939ee11fb99e42be8b3803a61a456c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787204329", "website": "https://decktronic.org/snop", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</stron